<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どーも　すいませーん▼
ほんとう　きょうしゅく　ですけど
おいしいみず　１ぽん▽
３００円で　かいませんか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T13:01:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どーも　すいませーん▼
本当　恐縮ですけど
おいしいみず　１本▽
３００円で　買いませんか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T13:01:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→middleman1_02
　はい、だけど所持金不足→middleman1_11
　はい、だけどバッグ一杯→middleman1_12
　いいえ→middleman1_10
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T03:47:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:54:52" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ありがとう　ございます！▼
３００円と　いつもより　たかい
おいしいみずを　かってくれるだなんて▽
こころの　ひろい　おかた　だ！▼
この　ごおんは
いっしょう　わすれません！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:21:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ありがとう　ございます！▼
３００円と　いつもより　高い
おいしいみずを　買ってくれるだなんて▽
なんと　心の　広い　お方だ！▼
この　ご恩は
一生　忘れません！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:22:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択時
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:08:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:55:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ええ　わかってます
わかってますとも！▼
１ぽん　３００円は　たかいって！▼
でもね　おじさんも
これ　かってもらわないと▽
いろいろ　きびしいんですよ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:00:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ええ　わかってます
わかってますとも！▼
１本　３００円は　高いって！▼
でもね　おじさんも
これ　買ってもらわないと▽
いろいろ　厳しいんですよ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T13:00:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択
・続けてmiddleman1_04から07のどれかを
　ランダムで抽出して表示
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:10:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:55:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つまが　おたかい　ブランドものの
カバンを　ほしがっていて……▼
かわないと　ふうふの　かんけいが
ギクシャク　しそう　なんです……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>妻が　お高い　ブランドものの
カバンを　欲しがっていて……▼
買わないと　夫婦の　関係が
ギクシャク　しそう　なんです……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ランダムその１
・続けてmiddleman1_09
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:11:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:55:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>むすめが　トレーナー　なんですけどね▼
あたらしい　ハイパーボールとか
すごいキズぐすりとか　いろいろ▽
かってあげたいのが　おや　ですよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>愛娘が　トレーナー　なんですけどね▼
新しい　ハイパーボールとか
すごいキズぐすりとか　いろいろ▽
買ってあげたいのが　親心ですよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ランダムその２
・続けてmiddleman1_09
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:11:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:55:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>むすこ　ふうふ　からの
しおくりが　へってきましてね……▼
ひとに　たよってちゃ　いけませんが
ほら　いろいろ　あるじゃないですか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あのですね　息子夫婦からの
仕送りが　減ってきましてね……▼
人に　頼ってちゃ　いけませんが
ほら　いろいろ　あるじゃないですか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ランダムその３
・続けてmiddleman1_09
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:11:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:55:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かわいい　まごに　おもちゃを
かって　あげたいんですけど▼
けっこう　たかいでしょ？　でも
よろこぶ　かおが　みたくてですね……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>可愛い　孫に　おもちゃを
買って　あげたいんですけど▼
結構　高いでしょ？　でも
喜ぶ　顔が　みたくてですね……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ランダムその４
・続けてmiddleman1_09
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:11:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:55:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>とくに　なにが　あるって
わけでは　ないんですがね……▼
きのう　フルコースりょうりを
たべたら　すごく　たかくって……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>とくに　なにが　あるって
わけでは　ないんですがね……▼
昨日　フルコース料理を
頼んだら　すごく　高くって……！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-31T12:01:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ランダムその５
・続けてmiddleman1_09
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:11:08" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:55:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だから　ここは
おじさんを　たすけると　おもって▼
おいしいみず　３００円で
かってください！　ね？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:21:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だから　ここは
おじさんを　助けると　思って▼
おいしいみず　３００円で
買ってください！　ね？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:27:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→middleman1_02
　はい、だけど所持金不足→middleman1_11
　はい、だけどバッグ一杯→middleman1_12
　いいえ→middleman1_10
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T03:46:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:55:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T04:05:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01_middleman1_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうですか……▼
そこまで　おっしゃるなら
おじさんも　あきらめますよ……▼
もしも　きが　かわったら
いつでも　きてください！▼
おじさんは　ここで　おいしいみずを
３００円で　うってますから……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:27:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうですか……▼
そこまで　おっしゃるなら
おじさんも　あきらめますよ……▼
もしも　気が　変わったら
いつでも　来てください！▼
おじさんは　ここで　おいしいみずを
３００円で　売ってますから……！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:27:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:13:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T12:12:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLWMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T11:56:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
